{"id":"n75510-1-8","stage":5,"title":"조마조마 · 提心吊胆地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75510-1-8-1","ko":"유민아, 자격증 시험 잘 봤어?","zh":"裕敏，资格证考试考得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"자격증","meaning":"资格证","explanation":"자격증：资格证","readings":[{"term":"자격증","audio":"/audio/be05f0c5d3e2c7cb3a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24762","senseId":"1","lemma":"자격증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"be05f0c5d3e2c7cb","term":"자격증","zh":"资格证","audio":"/audio/be05f0c5d3e2c7cb3a99.mp3","entryId":"24762","definition":"认证一定资格的证书。","pronunciation":["자격쯩"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/80bb8c75f67eb09630bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75510-1-8-2","ko":"모르겠어. 조마조마 마음만 졸이다가 제대로 답을 못 썼어.","zh":"不知道啊。心里一直紧张不安，结果根本没写对答案。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조마조마","meaning":"提心吊胆地","explanation":"조마조마：提心吊胆地","readings":[{"term":"조마조마","audio":"/audio/f66bd2a97c210d9cb08c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75510","senseId":"1","lemma":"조마조마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음만","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸이다가","meaning":"心焦，焦急","explanation":"졸이다：心焦，焦急；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"졸이다","audio":"/audio/58b39e2dcea294311524.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90326","senseId":"2","lemma":"졸이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"正常地，正规地","explanation":"제대로：正常地，正规地","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"답을","meaning":"应答，解答","explanation":"답：应答，解答；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"썼어.","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"f66bd2a97c210d9c","term":"조마조마","zh":"提心吊胆地","audio":"/audio/f66bd2a97c210d9cb08c.mp3","entryId":"75510","definition":"因为担心将要发生的事情而感到内心焦虑不安的样子。","pronunciation":["조마조마"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"58b39e2dcea29431","term":"졸이다","zh":"心焦，焦急","audio":"/audio/58b39e2dcea294311524.mp3","entryId":"90326","definition":"内心如灼烧般焦躁不安。","pronunciation":["조리다"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"正常地，正规地","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"以正确格式或标准、样子。","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"应答，解答","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对疑问或问题所要求的内容进行阐明；或指那种话。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"用铅笔或其它笔等书写工具在纸张等上划线而书写一定的字。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05cda23916a69cf9ddb1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.25,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75510","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不知道啊。心里一直紧张不安，结果根本没写对答案。","你最近在学校好像不太常见啊？","裕敏，资格证考试考得怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不知道啊。心里一直紧张不安，结果根本没写对答案。","裕敏，资格证考试考得怎么样？","你最近在学校好像不太常见啊？"],"answer":0}]}
